WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:01.855
Module 10.

00:00:01.855 --> 00:00:03.670
Advanced Yield Engineering.

00:00:03.670 --> 00:00:05.705
Part of Stage 4, Strategist.

00:00:07.005 --> 00:00:09.075
By the end of this module, you'll be

00:00:09.075 --> 00:00:11.872
able to build fixed, hedged and structured yield,

00:00:11.872 --> 00:00:14.410
and know exactly what each one is short.

00:00:14.410 --> 00:00:15.765
That's the standard.

00:00:15.765 --> 00:00:17.735
Every lesson moves you toward it.

00:00:19.035 --> 00:00:21.076
There are 9 lessons, starting with

00:00:21.076 --> 00:00:24.000
Fixed-rate yield: principal and yield tokens.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:25.979
Each one ends with a checklist to

00:00:25.979 --> 00:00:28.250
do for real, and a three-question quiz.

00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:31.114
If the topic is new to

00:00:31.114 --> 00:00:33.930
you, start with Mastery Starter 10.0.

00:00:33.930 --> 00:00:35.825
It takes about ten minutes.

00:00:35.825 --> 00:00:37.979
Then take the lessons in order, because

00:00:37.979 --> 00:00:40.110
each one builds on the one before.

00:00:40.110 --> 00:00:41.917
And do the checklists for real,

00:00:41.917 --> 00:00:43.950
with small test amounts, every time.

00:00:45.250 --> 00:00:47.735
Let's begin, with lesson 10.0.
